OL,3,GNEWSA'AI receptionist could not
OL,4,Aunderstand me after stroke'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman recovering from a stroke has
OL,7,Fsaid she was "upset and frustrated"
OL,8,Fthat an AI reception service at her GP
OL,9,Fsurgery could not understand her,
OL,10,Fprompting her to register elsewhere.
OL,12,FThe ASA surgery at Armthorpe near
OL,13,FDoncaster was one of many facilities
OL,14,Fusing a nationwide AI system called
OL,15,FEMMA to prevent long wait times on the
OL,16,Fphone.
OL,18,FJudith Butterfield, 71, said after her
OL,19,Fstroke she attempted to book a GP
OL,20,Fappointment five times but could not
OL,21,Fget past the AI service.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
