OL,3,GNEWSA'AI receptionist could not
OL,4,Aunderstand me after stroke'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPractice manager Claire Oxley said the
OL,7,FEMMA service had been "decommissioned"
OL,8,Fat Armthorpe and was no longer used at
OL,9,Fthe surgery.
